<tr><td>Are the numbers right?</td><td>Headline totals and growth rates match the central bank; {{ f.counts.SUPPORTED }} claims confirmed by a primary source</td><td>Use the figures; cite the central bank, not republishers</td></tr>
<tr><td>Does the report answer the buyer's decision?</td><td>{{ f.q5 }} of {{ f.n_claims }} claims on buyers staying; {{ f.crit_n }} on continuity, cost and contracting</td><td>The decisive evidence has to come from vendors and lawyers</td></tr>
